# The lobby aquarium. A built-in tank in a walnut case: fish, kelp, coral,
# a diver on the sand, bubbles from his helmet and from the airstone in the
# rocks, caustic light drifting across the water, and a light bar under the
# lid. 16 frames at 6 fps. The teal light pools on the floor in front at night.
sprite lobby-aquarium
size 64 48
layer object
footprint 4 1
origin 0 32
fps 6
tag aquarium decor light
light 32 20 44 #4cb0c0 0.6

